Package: EmpiricalBayesianWorkflow
Title: Mixed Model Workflow with Conformal Prediction
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Empirical Bayesian Workflow", "Contributor", 
           email = "example@example.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a complete workflow for fitting mixed models with
    flexible families using both frequentist (glmmTMB) and Bayesian (brms/Stan) 
    approaches. Includes automatic prior construction from frequentist estimates 
    with exact parameter mapping between packages, and conformal prediction for 
    uncertainty quantification. Supports multiple families including beta, 
    zero-inflated beta, gamma, Poisson, negative binomial, and their zero-inflated 
    variants. Uses cmdstanr as the default backend for Bayesian inference.
